  unitName: Remuihl
  unitId: 50063
  unitNumber: 703
  description: A mythical beast with a virtuous sword attached to its forehead, and
    rainbow wings covering its back. Said to be the sacred horse which pulled the
    tanks of the God Army, or a divine beast that can cut through the darkness, this
    creature is considered the best creation the gods ever made. The blade on its
    forehead is sharper than any sword humans are capable of producing, and it is
    said to be particularly effective when cutting down demons. For this reason Remuihl
    is believed to be a natural enemy of the demon race, and has thus come to adorn
    the temples of many countries as a charm of protection against evil.
  summonDesc: My horn will crush all evil.<br>If your heart is untrue,<br>I shall
    cut you in half.
  fusionDesc: My wings are shining.<br>This is proof of your noble heart.<br>You
    should be proud.
  evoDesc: You now possess the sword of light.<br>I will destroy anything in your
    path.
  element: 5
  rarity: 3
